  "body": "Built by a local Millwater builder & Master Builder this home was designed with multi-generational living in mind, this home offers a rare level of space and flexibility. A self-contained ground-floor wing provides the perfect solution for extended family, teens, or guests, featuring 2 bedrooms, a private lounge, and a full bathroom - a home within a home.\r\n\r\nWhat you'll love:\r\n\r\n*  Multi-generational living - self-contained ground floor with 2 bedrooms, lounge, and bathroom.\r\n\r\n*  Light-filled living - elevated, northwest aspect for sunshine all day long.\r\n\r\n*  Entertainer's dream - designer kitchen with walk-in pantry flowing to dining, family room, and a covered deck.\r\n\r\n*  Outdoor potential - low-maintenance garden with space for a pool.\r\n\r\n*  Four distinct living zones across two levels: formal lounge, family hub, teen/guest lounge, and upstairs retreat.\r\n\r\n*  Luxury master suite - walk-in wardrobe, spa-style en-suite with bath, and private deck for sunsets.\r\n\r\n*  Room for everyone - 6 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms, and multiple flexible living areas.\r\n\r\n*  Comfort year-round - central air conditioning plus modern chattels throughout.\r\n\r\n*  Generous parking - double garage plus off-street for 4 vehicles (or the boat).\r\n\r\nQuick Facts:\r\n\r\nBuilding: 312sqm\r\nLand: 600sqm\r\nBedrooms: 6\r\nBathrooms: 3.5\r\nParking: 2-car garage plus extra 4 car spaces on the property & off street parking\r\n\r\nCopy and paste the link to view/download documents:\r\nhttps://rwpinehill.co.nz/properties/residential-for-sale/rodney/orewa-0931/house/3330073#documents\r\n\r\nContact:\r\nShaun Burnett - 021 871 252 | shaun.burnett@raywhite.com\r\nLyn Templeman - 021 809 273 | lyn.templeman@raywhite.com\r\nLicensed REAA 2008",
